erik-theme (0.2.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Add the Erik Appearance app (erik-theme-gui): wallpaper, style and
    accent colour chooser. It opens once after the first login, replacing
    the GNOME welcome tour, and stays in the app grid.
  * Register Erik's logo as the vendor-logos alternative (priority 100), so
    the GDM login screen shows Erik instead of Debian.

